---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';
import { adsLive } from '../lib/ads';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description={`How ${SITE_NAME} handles your information.`}>
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <h1 class="display">Privacy</h1>
    <p>{SITE_NAME} doesn't ask for your name, email or phone number, and we don't have accounts.</p>
    <h2>What's stored on your device</h2>
    <p>Your shortlist and the number of lines you picked are saved in your browser's local storage, so they're still there when you come back. They never leave your device. Clear your browser's site data to remove them.</p>
    <h2>Calculators</h2>
    <p>The savings and phone-deal calculators run entirely in your browser. What you type isn't sent anywhere.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    {adsLive()
      ? <p>We show ads from Google. Google and its partners may use cookies to show ads based on your visits to this and other sites. You can turn off personalized ads in Google's Ad Settings.</p>
      : <p>We don't show ads yet. If we add them, this page will explain what the ad provider collects and how to opt out, before they appear.</p>}
    <h2>Links to carriers</h2>
    <p>Links to carrier websites take you to their sites, where their own privacy policies apply.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
<style>
  .prose { max-width: 760px; padding-block: 24px 64px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; font-size: 17px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 48px); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  h2 { font-size: 22px; margin-top: 12px; }
</style>
